silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_04_bridge_to_kg_growth_concrete_anchor_5 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_bridge_to_kg_growth #5', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Bridge to Knowledge Graph Growth Paper' the bare symbol ForgeAdmittedNode anchors to CitedVetRecordObject: The vet-record after citation key local-mittens-example-anchor-2026 is assigned and its source boundary is declared: this file is about Mittens, not Mittens itself. Same physical document; different Forge standing.." .
